/springbok-economy.pdf
/.quarto/
*_files/
*.knit.md
*.typ

# World Rugby's match-list pages. Its terms do not allow them to be republished;
# R/fetch_data.R extracts the facts the paper uses into
# data/raw/world_rugby/springbok_matches.csv, which is committed.
data/raw/world_rugby/*.json

